sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Owner as 分享者浏览器
    participant WC as Web Crypto API
    participant API as rustcloud-api
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Guest as 访问者浏览器

    Owner->>WC: 生成一次性 RSA 密钥对
    WC-->>Owner: ephemeral_pubkey / ephemeral_privkey
    Owner->>API: GET /api/v1/folders/:id/snapshot
    API->>DB: 查询文件夹子树、文档密钥密文
    DB-->>API: snapshot
    API-->>Owner: 密文 snapshot
    Owner->>Owner: 用自身 RSA 私钥解出各文档 DEK
    Owner->>WC: 用 ephemeral_pubkey 重包 DEK 与敏感元信息
    Owner->>API: POST /api/v1/folders/:id/share<br/>ephemeral_pubkey + manifest
    API->>DB: 保存 share_links
    API-->>Owner: access_token
    Owner-->>Guest: /share/{token}#esk={ephemeral_privkey}
    Guest->>API: GET /api/v1/shares/access/{token}<br/>浏览器不会发送 #esk
    API->>DB: 查询 share_links
    DB-->>API: ephemeral_pubkey + manifest
    API-->>Guest: 密文 manifest
    Guest->>Guest: 从 URL fragment 读取 ephemeral_privkey
    Guest->>WC: RSA-OAEP 解包 manifest 中的 DEK
    Guest->>WC: AES-GCM 解密文件名与文件内容

